// Avalanche map, the same avalanche as avalanche_sar_01 (see there) in the afternoon with light
// snowfall and haze (flat light: the debris and the snow around it are hard to tell apart), with
// other people: one in a light grey jacket buried to the chest near the top of the debris with one
// arm up, one lying near its toe, one in a black jacket standing on it (by a broken branch), and one
// who got out to its south edge, waving (between a boulder and a dwarf pine mat). Buried out of
// sight: two more, in the thickest debris. A blue snowboard, a pair of yellow skis and an orange
// backpack lie on it.
